       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-MORPHO-CLAY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MORPHO-CLAY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GROWTH-OK                PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MASS-SHIFT-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STRAIN-DISSIPATE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-METABOLISM-LATENCY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-METABOLISM-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-MORPHO-CLAY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PMG-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PMG-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GROWTH-AND-MASS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STRAIN-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PMG-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GROWTH-AND-MASS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GROWTH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MASS-SHIFT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STRAIN-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STRAIN-DISSIPATE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-METABOLISM-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PMG-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GROWTH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MASS-SHIFT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STRAIN-DISSIPATE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-METABOLISM-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-METABOLISM-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PMG-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PMG-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PMG-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PMG-CODE.
